  "content": "<p><strong>此模组需要&nbsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hammer-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=247401\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />&nbsp;HammerLib</a>。</strong></p>\n\n<p>欢迎！此模组为ProjectE添加了一些酷炫且强大的物品和方块！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>目前，它添加了（列表非常过时！）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>EMC 导管\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/conduit_mk1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />MK1 -&nbsp; 256 EMC/tick</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/conduit_mk2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />MK2 -&nbsp; 1 024 EMC/tick</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/conduit_mk3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />MK3 -&nbsp; 4 096 EMC/tick</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/conduit_mk4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />MK4 -&nbsp; 16 384 EMC/tick</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/zeitheron_fuel_block.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;Zeitheron 燃料块</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/blue_matter_block.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;蓝物质块</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/collector_mk4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;能量收集器 MK4</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/relay_mk4.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;反物质中继器 MK4</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/blue_matter.gif\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;蓝物质</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/zeitheron_fuel.gif\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;Zeitheron 燃料</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://tehenopengin.github.io/mod-icons/assets/equivadditions/emc_proxy.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;EMC 代理 - 吸收所有来自收集器、中继器和导管的EMC。当所有者在线时，将EMC传输到所有者的转化桌。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">目前，欢迎提出想法！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LuJJMv1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"698\" height=\"1\" /></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>权限：</strong></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>你可以在你的整合包中使用此模组。</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>未经提供Modrinth/CurseForge下载链接和我的许可（通过<a href=\"https://me.zeith.gay/\"><img src=\"https://dccg.herokuapp.com/discord/fetchAvatar/376091478142746625\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />&nbsp;Zeitheron</a>私信，或通过Discord），你不得将此模组重新发布到其他网站。</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>你不得将此模组（或DragonForge团队的任何其他模组）包含在你自己的模组中。然而，构建附加组件是允许的，但友好的私信会更好。</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>注意：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>唯一支持的Minecraft版本是此模组存在的最新版本。请勿要求降级！</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a class=\"js-qwynlraxz\" href=\"https://ds.zeith.org/dev\"><img src=\"https://ds.zeith.org/cards/dev.png\" width=\"510\" height=\"170\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>想讨论任何事情？需要API帮助？</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>加入Discord服务器并关注Zeitheron在<a href=\"http://bit.ly/ZeithTwitter\"><img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/favicons/twitter.ico\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />Twitter</a>！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>如果你想支持我的工作，可以通过<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/zeitheron\"><img src=\"https://c5.patreon.com/external/favicon/favicon-32x32.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;Patreon</a>成为赞助者。&nbsp;<img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/pix.iemoji.com/twit33/0744.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"33\" height=\"33\" /></strong></p>",
